+};
+
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Search
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+/**
+ * The promoted entity on the "all" tab: an ARTIST card whose only primary
+ * action signal is the button's text ("Shuffle") - it carries no
+ * `icon.iconType`. `extractCardAction` reads the two signals with `||`
